  "bodyHash": "ffd71e8d7480284b",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>沉浸式飛行器</h1>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-aircraft\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft\">\n<img alt=\"GitHub\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">\n<img alt=\"透過 Crowdin 翻譯\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n這個模組添加了許多復古風格的飛行器，用於旅行、運輸和探索！\n這些飛行器非常注重貼近原版風格，擁有豐富的細節與功能，同時不會過於複雜。\n</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=_immersive_aircraft%3Aaircraft&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersiveAircraft%2Ftree%2F1.20.1%3F%26c%3D1&resolution=48&background=fancy&row_size=10\" alt=\"生成的圖集圖片\"/></p>\n\n<p>對了，它還支援多人遊戲！</p>\n\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/screen1.jpg\"\nalt=\"螢幕截圖\"/>\n\n<h1>雙翼機</h1>\n<p>我們從經典的雙翼機開始。速度快、單人座、中等難度。</p>\n\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/biplane.jpg\"\nalt=\"螢幕截圖\"/>\n\n<h1>飛艇</h1>\n<p>速度較慢，但搭載兩個座位。操控相當靈活，後置引擎提供了可接受的航速。此外還有體積更大的貨運版本！</p>\n\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/airship.jpg\"\nalt=\"螢幕截圖\"/>\n\n<h1>旋翼機</h1>\n<p>人力驅動的原始雙座機型。可靠耐用，但並非最快或最容易操控的飛行器。需要借助外力助推才能讓旋翼開始旋轉。</p>\n\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/gyrodyne.jpg\"\nalt=\"螢幕截圖\"/>\n\n<h1>四軸飛行器</h1>\n<p>工程學的精緻傑作！四個螺旋槳綁在幾根竹竿上。對於建築來說非常實用。</p>\n\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/quadrocopter.jpg\"\nalt=\"螢幕截圖\"/>\n\n<h1>空中戰艦</h1>\n<p>\n銅鐵鑄造的龐然大物，為征服天空而生！\n搭載四個座位、可動砲塔、六個武器掛載點，體型甚至超越了 Minecraft 物理引擎的想像。\n</p>\n\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/warship.jpg\"\nalt=\"螢幕截圖\"/>\n\n<h1>組裝配件</h1>\n<p>由於飛行器通常比船隻等載具更為複雜，因此加入了若干配件，讓製作過程更有實際組裝的感覺。</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=immersive_aircraft%3A.%2A&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersiveAircraft%2Ftree%2F1.20.1%3F%26c%3D1&resolution=16&animated=False&row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的配方圖片\"/></p>\n\n<h1>物品欄</h1>\n<p>升級槽位、燃料、旗幟、染料、火箭推進器以及儲物空間。為你的飛行器打造專屬外觀！</p>\n\n<img width=\"550\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=550,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/inventory.jpg\"\nalt=\"螢幕截圖\"/>\n\n<h1>豐富升級項目</h1>\n<p>根據你的喜好升級並調校你的飛行器！</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=_immersive_aircraft%3Aupgrades&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersiveAircraft%2Ftree%2F1.20.1%3F%26c%3D1&resolution=48&background=fancy&row_size=10\" alt=\"生成的圖集圖片\"/></p>\n\n<p>為你的飛行器安裝各種武器與實用裝置！</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=_immersive_aircraft%3Aweapons&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersiveAircraft%2Ftree%2F1.20.1%3F%26c%3D1&resolution=48&background=fancy&row_size=10\" alt=\"生成的圖集圖片\"/></p>\n\n<h1>影片</h1>\n<iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-XOlaZHOu4I?wmode=transparent\"\nheight=\"480\" width=\"872\"></iframe>\n\n<h1>擴充模組</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/man-of-many-planes\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man%20of%20Many%20Planes&description=A%20set%20of%20additional%20aircraft%20for%20Immersive%20Aircraft%20with%20Create%20support%20in%20mind.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"多機之選\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-machinery\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Machinery&description=A%20bunch%20of%20rustic%20machinery%20to%20transport%2C%20mine%2C%20and%20automate%20things.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式機械\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aviator-dreams\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Aviator%20Dreams&description=Real%20life%20planes%20from%20small%20to%20big.&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1100/961/64/64/638648594348458560.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"飛行員之夢\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ia-remaining-airborne\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Remaining%20Airborne&description=A%20set%20of%20classic%20fighters.&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1168/829/64/64/638739800864929977.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"經典戰機\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/warfare-wings\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Warfare%20Wings&description=Adds%20many%20WWII%20fighters%20in%20different%20paint%20designs.&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1225/83/64/64/638802892619093611.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"戰爭之翼\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ia_engines\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Better%20Engines&description=Adds%20a%20lot%20of%20new%20upgrades%2C%20mostly%20engines%2C%20but%20also%20a%20turbocharger%20and%20a%20supercharger.&icon_url=https%3A//raw.githubusercontent.com/legoaggelos/ia_engines/refs/heads/main/common/src/main/resources/assets/more_engines/textures/item/supercharger.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"強化引擎\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/civilian-aviation\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Civilian%20Aviation&description=Featuring%20stylised%20real%20life%20planes%20and%20helicopters%20from%20all%20eras!&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1808/958/256/256/639144393942056440.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"民用航空\"/>\n</a></p>\n\n<h1>資源包</h1>\n<p>不喜歡我的風格，或是希望有更好的 Create 模組整合？來看看這些精彩的資源包吧！</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/more-immersive-aircraft\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=More%20Immersive%20Aircraft&description=Vanilla%20friendly%20and%20more%20realistic%20textures%20for%20Immersive%20Aircraft.&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1180/610/64/64/638753853503436917.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"更多沉浸式飛行器\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircrafts-resource-pack\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create%20Immersive%20Aircraft&description=Create-styled%20Immersive%20Aircraft%20resource-%20and%20datapack.&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/849/496/64/64/638250478085753003.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Create 沉浸式飛行器\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-style-modded-compats\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create%20Style%20Compats&description=Item%20textures%20in%20Create%20style.&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/485/413/64/64/637785634308178232.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Create 風格相容包\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/faithful-32x-immersive-aircraft\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Faithful%20-%20Immersive%20Aircrafts&description=FAITHFUL%2032x%20resource%20pack%20for%20Immersive%20Aircraft.&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/798/431/64/64/638160303843226902.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"忠實還原 - 沉浸式飛行器\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircraft-warship\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create%20IA%3A%20Warship&description=Create-styled%20textures%20for%20the%20Warship.&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1004/277/64/64/638525212330806757.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Create IA：空中戰艦\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/create-immersive-aircrafts-andesite-chests-compat\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create%20Andesite%20Chests&description=Create-styled%20andesite%20chests%20for%20all%20aircraft.&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1010/406/64/64/638534030337746940.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Create 花崗岩箱\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/danceboys-biplane-to-xwing\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Danceboys%20X-wing&description=Replaces%20the%20biplane%20with%20an%20x-wing!&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1327/379/64/64/638862867702387346.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Danceboys X翼\"/>\n</a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1>沉浸式系列</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-armors\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Armors&description=A%20lot%20of%20unique%20and%20vanilla-faithful%20armor%20sets.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式護甲\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-aircraft\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Aircraft&description=A%20bunch%20of%20rustic%20aircraft%20to%20travel%2C%20transport%2C%20and%20explore!&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式飛行器\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-melodies\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Melodies&description=Play%20custom%20melodies%20on%20various%20instruments%20and%20annoy%20your%20friends!&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式旋律\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Paintings&description=Drag%20and%20drop%2C%20pixelate%20and%20hang%20up%20beautiful%20art.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式畫作\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-optimization\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Optimization&description=A%20lightweight%20entity-tick-scheduler%20for%20doubling%20your%20TPS.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式優化\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/selectivebounds\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=Hides%20the%20ugly%20block%20selection%20outline%20when%20not%20relevant.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"SelectiveBounds\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-furniture\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Furniture&description=Create%20custom%20and%20fancy%20furniture%20in-game%20or%20choose%20from%20a%20vast%20online%20library.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式家具\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-gateways\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Gateways&description=Mysterious%2C%20long-forgotten%20portals%20scattered%20across%20the%20Overworld.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式傳送門\"/>\n</a></p>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=b385a88157b140101b9936c1a3266cfb\" alt=\"頁面雜湊值，便於部署。\"/>",
